  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vegan gravy simmers into a silky, savory comfort that instantly makes any meal feel special. Golden shallots and garlic build warmth, while earthy mushrooms and tamari add deep umami without any dairy. A swirl of cashew cream gives it that rich, velvety finish that clings perfectly to mashed potatoes, roasted vegetables, biscuits, or a veggie loaf. Easy to make and packed with cozy flavor, vegan gravy is the kind of plant based staple that has everyone reaching for seconds.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-vegan-gravy\">Why You’ll Love This Vegan gravy</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-vegan-gravy\">How to Make Vegan Gravy</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-vegan-gravy\">Pro Tips for Making Vegan gravy</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-vegan-gravy\">How to Serve this Vegan gravy</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-vegan-gravy\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Vegan gravy</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Rich and creamy texture that elevates any dish.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Made with wholesome plant-based ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to whip up in under 30 minutes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for drizzling over mashed potatoes or veggie dishes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Free from animal products, making it a guilt-free choice.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-9158\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"9158\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 m